### Home
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Path module demo
GET http://localhost:5000/api/path/inspect?filename=class-notes.txt

### Create async note
POST http://localhost:5000/api/async-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn async fs",
  "body": "fs/promises is preferred in web APIs."
}

### Get async notes
GET http://localhost:5000/api/async-notes

### Create sync note
POST http://localhost:5000/api/sync-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn sync fs",
  "body": "Sync fs blocks the event loop. Educational only."
}

### Get sync notes
GET http://localhost:5000/api/sync-notes

### Emit custom event
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events/demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Students triggered a custom event"
}

### Read event logs
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events/logs

### Clear event logs
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/events/logs
